@startuml
[*] --> RequestReceived : Video suggestion request received from a user
RequestReceived --> VideosGathered : User identified and different types of videos gathered
VideosGathered --> DetailsAdded : Additional details added to suggested videos
DetailsAdded --> SuggestedVideosSent : Suggested videos sent to user
SuggestedVideosSent --> [*] : Final state reached

@enduml
